  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LR Marine &#x2013;  Reducing energy loss in pipe systems for the process industry in Tanzania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to set up a local production via local partners that assist setting up a local production of pipe insulation. The company need to uncover the challenges in setting up a business entity in Tanzania, to dertermine how to establish the company and what type of business entity will be the best and the company need to find out if the production should be in the capital Dar es Salaam or in the port area of Tanga by allocating: local raw-material providers, local machine builders, governmental approvals and local transport companies.</narrative>
  </description>
